//
//   id       'd<day>q<slot>' — authored day and play order (slot 1..40)
//   cat      one of eight categories; each tier block covers all eight
//   tier     1 (gimme) .. 5 (brutal); a day ramps 8 questions per tier
//   choices  exactly four, one defensibly correct; the order was shuffled
//            deterministically at build time so the correct position is
//            patternless — do NOT hand-reorder choices here
//
// Facts are evergreen general knowledge, verified at authoring time
// (2026-07-31 for days 1..61, 2026-09-05 for days 62 on).
//
// DAYS 1..61 ARE HAND-WRITTEN AND FROZEN. Every id from d62 on is GENERATED by
// scripts/gen-streak.mjs from scripts/streak-source.mjs; edit the source and
// rebuild rather than touching those lines here, because the correct-answer
// column is computed across the whole day and a hand edit silently breaks it.
// The bank's authoring rules, and which of them are machine-checked from which
// date, are set out in the header of puzzles.js.
